age URL. For 100+ cards or a repair/migration, stop and apply `zenray-git-bulk-safety`.\n\nNever commit source code changes or store external poster URLs directly. Report title, category, status, score, and the immutable poster URL.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Ajoute anime : You and I are polar opposite : vérifie le titre."}]},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"36d89da0-7481-4f11-8f71-8eff2ca78975","timestamp":"2026-08-20T14:26:29.060Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/Memory","sessionId":"1393489a-77f2-4dd0-9c0e-85b7d7ef0ec1","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main"}
